{"started_at":61.692742109298706,"published_at":77.26684021949768,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-23a12323dafaf2df7c8d0dc4","text":"…大きな原動力となり、私たち一人ひとりがその変革に参加しました。今日、私たち皆が今にも口にしようとしている問いが一つあります。技術的特異点を前に、私たちはどうすれば新たな…を開き、…未来を解き放つことができるのでしょうか。","source_ids":["c000002-l0000","c000002-l0001","c000003-l0000"],"uncertain_source_ids":["c000003-l0000"],"start_seconds":30.0,"end_seconds":47.0,"generated_at":77.2658429145813,"published_at":77.26684021949768,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{"c000003-l0000":["repetition"]}},{"id":"tr-6cf9e3d554262dbc61286baa","text":"…実際のところ、民主主義は脅威にさらされています。とりわけ、AIを使って私たちの信頼の基盤を損ない、弱めようとする権威主義者たちによる脅威です。…将来、世界は世界の非常に重要な一部です。世界は世界の非常に重要な一部です。…","source_ids":["c000003-l0001","c000003-l0002","c000003-l0003","c000003-l0004","c000003-l0005","c000003-l0006"],"uncertain_source_ids":["c000003-l0001","c000003-l0002","c000003-l0003","c000003-l0004","c000003-l0005","c000003-l0006"],"start_seconds":47.0,"end_seconds":60.0,"generated_at":77.2658429145813,"published_at":77.26684021949768,"boundary_reason":"source_gap","uncertainty_reasons":{"c000003-l0001":["repetition"],"c000003-l0002":["repetition"],"c000003-l0003":["repetition"],"c000003-l0004":["repetition","timestamp_outside_audio"],"c000003-l0005":["repetition","timestamp_outside_audio"],"c000003-l0006":["repetition","timestamp_outside_audio"]}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.008581,"usage_confirmed":true}
