{"started_at":92.75873684883118,"published_at":106.25073313713074,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-7798280634cc0a2604a2c553","text":"今日、民主主義体制の下で暮らす人々はわずか10億人である一方、その2倍を超える人々は、権威主義的な支配の下で「POIL」しています。本書の序文で述べたように、プルラリティという概念は、民主主義と協働的なテクノロジーの共生を象徴しています。","source_ids":["c000004-l0001","c000004-l0002","c000005-l0000"],"uncertain_source_ids":[],"start_seconds":66.0,"end_seconds":85.56,"generated_at":106.24871706962585,"published_at":106.25073313713074,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.007431,"usage_confirmed":true}
