{"started_at":169.256982088089,"published_at":174.99771118164062,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-6ee3205287404e4c999d8770","text":"そのイベントで私は、Collective Intelligence Project、OpenAI、Anthropic、そしてGetting Plurality Research Networkと連携したAIの民主化に対し、分野を横断して支持の声が高まる中、台湾の革新的なデジタル民主主義のモデルを紹介します。\nさて、こちらをご覧ください。一つひとつの思考が意見を表し、暗闇の中の星のように輝いています。","source_ids":["c000008-l0000","c000008-l0001","c000009-l0000","c000009-l0001"],"uncertain_source_ids":["c000009-l0001"],"start_seconds":120.0,"end_seconds":150.0,"generated_at":174.99619102478027,"published_at":174.99771118164062,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{"c000009-l0001":["timestamp_outside_audio"]}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.005301,"usage_confirmed":true}
{"started_at":184.46116304397583,"published_at":190.06820106506348,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-96748e37f56ced0d85bdd24b","text":"…背景。全体を捉えた考察が星座を形づくり、アラインメントの方向性を私たちに示してくれます。多くの参加者にとって、熟議の文脈でAIとやり取りするのは、これが初めてです。それは一人だけの会話としてではなく、共通の利益のために発展していく集団での議論として行われます。","source_ids":["c000010-l0000","c000010-l0001","c000011-l0000"],"uncertain_source_ids":[],"start_seconds":150.0,"end_seconds":171.4,"generated_at":190.0671670436859,"published_at":190.06820106506348,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.004826,"usage_confirmed":true}
{"started_at":199.61110091209412,"published_at":205.08347606658936,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-096091b69a3b9c6a282380ea","text":"このように拡張された熟議は、誰もが、そしてあらゆる人が、デジタル民主主義への貢献者にも、その恩恵を受ける者にもなれることを意味します。これは社会の回復力の向上につながり、情報の健全性を高めるとともに、異文化間の理解と共感を深めます。","source_ids":["c000011-l0001","c000012-l0000","c000012-l0001"],"uncertain_source_ids":["c000011-l0001"],"start_seconds":173.16,"end_seconds":190.96,"generated_at":205.07800912857056,"published_at":205.08347606658936,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{"c000011-l0001":["timestamp_outside_audio"]}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.0045035,"usage_confirmed":true}
