{"started_at":245.034441947937,"published_at":249.13842606544495,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-de2d9227528b9cfd289fdceb","text":"それでも、直接民主主義という考えが完全に消え去ったわけではありません。プルラリティを通じて、私たちは互恵性に根ざした共同体の精神を、より高い次元で再発見しています。","source_ids":["c000014-l0001","c000015-l0000"],"uncertain_source_ids":["c000014-l0001"],"start_seconds":217.04,"end_seconds":230.0,"generated_at":249.1362659931183,"published_at":249.13842606544495,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{"c000014-l0001":["timestamp_outside_audio"]}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.004576,"usage_confirmed":true}
{"started_at":260.0809049606323,"published_at":272.8654489517212,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-fc78c67c3e394bff012aec84","text":"実際、共通の価値観に基づく協働は、私たちの地域社会だけに解決策を提供することにとどまりません。共通のリスクや害について、社会的な評価、測定、軽減に参加することで、私たちは相互信頼の基盤を築き、共有する未来へと進む道を切り開くことができます。","source_ids":["c000015-l0001","c000015-l0002","c000016-l0000","c000016-l0001"],"uncertain_source_ids":[],"start_seconds":230.0,"end_seconds":252.64,"generated_at":272.8633689880371,"published_at":272.8654489517212,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.0015649,"usage_confirmed":true}
{"started_at":280.5522623062134,"published_at":288.15601110458374,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-65b9e0089fc71ba51896a3c7","text":"…インターネットに関しては。地理的な境界はなく、あるのは価値観の近さだけです。","source_ids":["c000017-l0000","c000017-l0001","c000017-l0002"],"uncertain_source_ids":[],"start_seconds":255.0,"end_seconds":261.82,"generated_at":288.1536271572113,"published_at":288.15601110458374,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.004461,"usage_confirmed":true}
{"started_at":301.12317395210266,"published_at":310.6998379230499,"blocks":[{"id":"tr-27389fe5b0814c1534f63235","text":"技術の急速な進歩と、グローバル化によって激しさを増す分極化に直面する今、私たちが多元性への取り組みをさらに強める機は熟しています。相互運用可能な共存を通じて、私たちは影響力があり、意義深いもの、すなわち協働する多様性を実現しています。\n最後に、祈りを捧げさせてください。\nモノのインターネットを目にしたとき、それを存在のインターネットにしていきましょう。","source_ids":["c000017-l0003","c000017-l0004","c000017-l0005","c000018-l0000","c000018-l0001","c000019-l0000","c000019-l0001"],"uncertain_source_ids":[],"start_seconds":262.54,"end_seconds":294.14,"generated_at":310.6984829902649,"published_at":310.6998379230499,"boundary_reason":"sentence","uncertainty_reasons":{}}],"selection":{"source_policy_version":1,"excluded_sources":[{"source_id":"c000003-l0007","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0008","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"},{"source_id":"c000003-l0009","reason":"duplicate_invalid_timing","duplicate_of":"c000003-l0006"}]},"cache_hit":false,"cost_usd":0.006436,"usage_confirmed":true}
